# Agentic Dev Toolkit

This repository ships the Cursor plugin Agentic Dev Toolkit (see `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`).

## Skills — read before acting

| Trigger | Skill path |
|---|---|
| Any visual UI change | `skills/visual-quality-gate/SKILL.md` |
| Before Done / merge | `skills/verify-handoff/SKILL.md` |
| Any automation need | `skills/no-disposable-scripts/SKILL.md` |
| Measuring task signals / model routing data | `skills/code-metrics/SKILL.md` |

Stack-specific conventions (languages, frameworks, design tools) come from **conversation context**, not shareable plugin skills.

Paths are relative to this plugin root (or `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/` when vendored).

## Hard rules

1. **Verify before Done** — run applicable gates; call `bin/verify-checklist`. Fill gate criteria from the stack/design SoT stated in context.
2. **No disposable scripts** — use `bin/` / `tools/` / repo CLI; extend them in-repo instead of `/tmp` bash.
3. Prefer toolbox bins under this plugin over one-off shell.

## Toolbox entry points

- `bin/verify-checklist` (alias: `tools/verify-checklist`)
- `bin/metrics-append` (alias: `tools/metrics-append`)
- `bin/metrics-summarize` (alias: `tools/metrics-summarize`) — optional before spawn to pick a model from JSONL
